  '將清除目前毛孩的食品卡、紀錄、提醒與草稿，恢復示範資料。清除前會留一份副本；之後可在畫面下方按「復原」，或到設定 › 資料與備份（只保留最近一次）。毛孩名字與資料保留；其他毛孩與家庭觀察不受影響。': "This clears this pet's food cards, records, reminders, and drafts and restores demo data. A copy is kept first; you can tap \"Undo\" at the bottom of the screen or go to Settings › Data & backup (only the most recent copy is kept). The pet's name and profile are kept; other pets and family observations are not affected.",
  '恢復示範資料': 'Restore demo data',
  '目前毛孩已恢復示範，其他毛孩未變更': 'Demo restored for this pet. Other pets are unchanged.',
  '已恢復示範資料': 'Demo data restored',
  '正在清除，請稍候…': 'Clearing, please wait…',
  '只會清除目前毛孩的照護紀錄、由餵食建立的生活變化與未完成的食品／餵食草稿，保留食品卡、毛孩資料和獨立標記的生活變化。清除前會留一份副本；之後可在畫面下方按「復原」，或到設定 › 資料與備份（只保留最近一次）。': "This only clears this pet's care records, life changes created from feedings, and unfinished food/feeding drafts. Food cards, the pet profile, and separately marked life changes are kept. A copy is kept first; you can tap \"Undo\" at the bottom of the screen or go to Settings › Data & backup (only the most recent copy is kept).",
  '清除紀錄與未完成的紀錄': 'Clear records and unfinished records',
  '已清除紀錄與未完成的紀錄': 'Records and unfinished records cleared',
