  '進階模式文字潤整規劃中，服務商、價格與額度待定。目前不產生報告、不計次、不扣額度，也不會在本機失敗後自動上傳。': 'Advanced mode text polishing is being planned; provider, pricing, and credits are not decided yet. For now no reports are generated, nothing is counted, no credits are used, and nothing is uploaded automatically if on-device processing fails.',
  '語音與照片的模型、成本與配額另行規劃；本版沒有錄音、上傳或 AI 推論。': 'Models, costs, and quotas for voice and photos are planned separately. This version does not record, upload, or run AI inference.',
