  '只刪除這個生活變化及其對照入口，原始觀察與餵食紀錄會保留。': 'Only this life change and its comparison link are deleted. Original observations and feeding records are kept.',
  '生活變化已刪除': 'Life change deleted',
  '確認刪除生活變化': 'Delete life change',
  '保留生活變化': 'Keep life change',
  '刪除後，這筆紀錄及由它建立、尚未獨立修改的換糧標記都會移除，其他生活變化會保留。刪除後可按畫面下方的「復原」找回，只保留最近一次。': "This record and any food change marks created from it (that you haven't edited separately) will be removed. Other life changes are kept. You can tap \"Undo\" at the bottom of the screen to get it back; only the most recent one is kept.",
  '刪除後，這筆紀錄也會從看診摘要移除。刪除後可按畫面下方的「復原」找回，只保留最近一次。': "This record will also be removed from the vet summary. You can tap \"Undo\" at the bottom of the screen to get it back; only the most recent one is kept.",
