  '尚未儲存的內容會被捨棄。': 'Unsaved content will be discarded.',
  '捨棄並離開': 'Discard and leave',
  '這是毛孩小本本的 UI／UX 示範。進階模式是預設整理方式；手機模式需裝置支援並下載模型。手動記錄、預覽、核對和直接儲存都能使用；送出進階模式前仍會請你確認。聲音探索提供 8 段實際錄音與 4 段人工合成音效，需手動播放，離開即停止。免費每日隨機 2 種，新增真實照護紀錄可再開 1 種；Pro 全部自選；「無聲首次示範」只演示倒數與選擇，不播放音訊。語音記錄使用固定例句，不開啟麥克風、不辨識錄音。最後一次無聲 DEMO 選擇只保存在目前貓咪的本機檔案，不寫入照護紀錄或健康統計。食品卡、紀錄、毛孩資料與食品／餵食草稿保存於這台裝置，不連接線上、帳號或後端。其他表單草稿未保存；刪除 App 前請先匯出備份檔。':
    "This is an InPaw UI/UX demo. Advanced mode is the default way to organize notes; On-device mode needs device support and a model download. Manual entry, preview, checking, and direct saving all work; you'll still be asked to confirm before anything is sent to Advanced mode. Sound Explorer offers 8 real recordings and 4 synthesized sounds, played by hand and stopped when you leave. Free: 2 random sounds per day, plus 1 more when you add a real care record; Pro: choose any. The \"silent first demo\" only shows the countdown and choice, with no audio. Voice log uses fixed example phrases; the microphone is not turned on and nothing is recognized. The last silent demo choice is saved only in this cat's local file and is not written to care records or health stats. Food cards, records, pet profiles, and food/feeding drafts are saved on this device, with no online connection, account, or server. Other form drafts are not saved; export a backup before deleting the app.",
